{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/2d52aa89c8d5537b6c7c244ef60b7c70.avif?t=1766382931\" width=1280 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamancer is a Roguelike video game that uses procedural generation for every sprite, item, map and faction making for a unique playing experience each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/662b001cce7b938d34c3cff28c79f4c9.avif?t=1766382931\" width=1278 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Metamancer you don't equip armor or weapons, you <strong>ARE</strong> the weapon. Skills take on different forms as the player progresses. The game is all about combining skills and buffs in creative ways to push into more and more difficult areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/d1f643494439095dbe9391cb0df321db.poster.avif?t=1766382931\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/d1f643494439095dbe9391cb0df321db.webm?t=1766382931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/d1f643494439095dbe9391cb0df321db.mp4?t=1766382931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0The player equips components into a Motherboard that give them skills and buffs. Skills and buffs can be combined in various ways to push the player deeper into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/7405d8188e964a1950fe6b5a0b4769ee.poster.avif?t=1766382931\" width=736 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/7405d8188e964a1950fe6b5a0b4769ee.webm?t=1766382931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/7405d8188e964a1950fe6b5a0b4769ee.mp4?t=1766382931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully procedural world where every sprite is unique!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A procedurally generated quest system!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural dialogue!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tetris-Meets-RPG character building!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARPG style loot!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction territory combat system!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom character creator!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player reputation system!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild skill combinations!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Motherboard is where you get all your skills and powers. Motherboards are color coded to take components you find while playing. Motherboard consist of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GPUs</strong> that give you your main skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPUs</strong> that give massive flat buffs but have complicated shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAM</strong> that gives special effects and buffs to skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSUs</strong> that give you power to run the components.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>FANs</strong> to manage the heat from using your skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 10 Distinct biomes that the player can visit including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Forest</strong>: Nature-tech fusion zones with bio-adaptive creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Ruins</strong>: Abandoned urban decay ruled by street gangs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrapyard</strong>: Industrial waste zones perfect for component scavenging.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Industrial Zone</strong>: Corporate-controlled factory complexes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon District</strong>: High-tech commercial centers blazing with holograms.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutated Swamp</strong>: Bio-hazard zones where genetic experiments roam free.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wasteland Mines</strong>: Synthetic-controlled resource extraction sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Data Nexus:</strong>\u00a0Massive data centers filled with towering server stacks and glowing conduit networks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crashed Orbital:\u00a0</strong>Wreckage of a fallen orbital station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biotech Lab:\u00a0</strong>Abandoned biotech research facility with growth vats and containment chambers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamancer has <strong>four factions</strong> that are constantly battling for territory on the world map. The factions are split into two alliance blocks that the player can align themselves with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As faction territories change, the maps change too. Factions leave a physical mark on the map with strongholds at the centers of their territory.\u00a0Sometimes you'll see the alliances fighting against each other on world tiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/f172107d2ad5709b464097ae5675f444.avif?t=1766382931\" width=1278 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886130?t=1766382931","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886130?t=1766382931","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/b62659f2e277bcd31c4ad0189002c10fdba53fdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766382931","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/b62659f2e277bcd31c4ad0189002c10fdba53fdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766382931","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/2d52aa89c8d5537b6c7c244ef60b7c70.avif?t=1766382931\" width=1280 height=201 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamancer is a Roguelike video game that uses procedural generation for every sprite, item, map and faction making for a unique playing experience each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/662b001cce7b938d34c3cff28c79f4c9.avif?t=1766382931\" width=1278 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Metamancer you don't equip armor or weapons, you <strong>ARE</strong> the weapon. Skills take on different forms as the player progresses. The game is all about combining skills and buffs in creative ways to push into more and more difficult areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/d1f643494439095dbe9391cb0df321db.poster.avif?t=1766382931\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/d1f643494439095dbe9391cb0df321db.webm?t=1766382931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/d1f643494439095dbe9391cb0df321db.mp4?t=1766382931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0The player equips components into a Motherboard that give them skills and buffs. Skills and buffs can be combined in various ways to push the player deeper into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/7405d8188e964a1950fe6b5a0b4769ee.poster.avif?t=1766382931\" width=736 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/7405d8188e964a1950fe6b5a0b4769ee.webm?t=1766382931\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/7405d8188e964a1950fe6b5a0b4769ee.mp4?t=1766382931\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully procedural world where every sprite is unique!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A procedurally generated quest system!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural dialogue!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tetris-Meets-RPG character building!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ARPG style loot!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Faction territory combat system!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom character creator!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player reputation system!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild skill combinations!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Motherboard is where you get all your skills and powers. Motherboards are color coded to take components you find while playing. Motherboard consist of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GPUs</strong> that give you your main skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CPUs</strong> that give massive flat buffs but have complicated shapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RAM</strong> that gives special effects and buffs to skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PSUs</strong> that give you power to run the components.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>FANs</strong> to manage the heat from using your skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are over 10 Distinct biomes that the player can visit including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber Forest</strong>: Nature-tech fusion zones with bio-adaptive creatures.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City Ruins</strong>: Abandoned urban decay ruled by street gangs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrapyard</strong>: Industrial waste zones perfect for component scavenging.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Industrial Zone</strong>: Corporate-controlled factory complexes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neon District</strong>: High-tech commercial centers blazing with holograms.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mutated Swamp</strong>: Bio-hazard zones where genetic experiments roam free.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wasteland Mines</strong>: Synthetic-controlled resource extraction sites.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Data Nexus:</strong>\u00a0Massive data centers filled with towering server stacks and glowing conduit networks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crashed Orbital:\u00a0</strong>Wreckage of a fallen orbital station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biotech Lab:\u00a0</strong>Abandoned biotech research facility with growth vats and containment chambers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metamancer has <strong>four factions</strong> that are constantly battling for territory on the world map. The factions are split into two alliance blocks that the player can align themselves with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As faction territories change, the maps change too. Factions leave a physical mark on the map with strongholds at the centers of their territory.\u00a0Sometimes you'll see the alliances fighting against each other on world tiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886130/extras/f172107d2ad5709b464097ae5675f444.avif?t=1766382931\" width=1278 height=288 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Colter Grant Robinson